# Domain (feature module)

## Boundaries

- **No** Nest, Prisma, AJV, Socket.IO, HTTP DTOs, presentation, infrastructure
- Imports: same feature `domain/*`, `@shared/domain/*`, other features' **domain** types only when necessary
- Path: `src/modules/<feature>/domain/...`

## Where things live

| What | Where |
|---|---|
| Fields, enums, policies, entity errors, select-fields | `entities/<entity>/` |
| DB ports + tokens | `repositories/<entity>/` |
| Auth kinds / caller types (authorization feature) | `authorization/domain/auth/` |
| Shared ISP repos, query types, TX | `@shared/domain/...` |

## Canonical

- Etalon entity: `masters/domain/entities/master-service`
- Etalon repo port: `masters/domain/repositories/master-service`
- Full sequence: `entity-creation-sequence.mdc`
- Skill: `domain-entity`, `domain-repository`
